        "fix": "Add a dated pass to handoff.md, or a section of research_notes/morphometry/README.md, that records the cache's configurations, the alteration list with their parameters and the scratch scripts by name (marked not committed), mark What is left item 1 done, and point the docstring's \"scratch cache\" and phantom.py's \"wall-slope study\" at that record. Or commit the scorer.",
